00:07:58.230 --> 00:07:58.730
SACHIN KOTWANI: That's correct.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:07:59.000
MARK MANDEL: OK.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:07:59.600
Cool.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:03.256
So you said as well, there's
a bunch of built-in ML Kit

00:08:03.256 --> 00:08:05.630
functionality that people
don't have to build themselves.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.760
What is that functionality
that's available?

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.843
