00:08:30.373 --> 00:08:32.039
SACHIN KOTWANI: That's
a great question.

00:08:32.039 --> 00:08:35.630
So as I mentioned earlier,
these APIs or these use cases,

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.250
are available both
